 "about_text": "GALLERY KTO is a contemporary art gallery based in Tokyo, with spaces in Shinjuku and Harajuku, founded in 2019. Under director Toshinori Tanaka, it has shown internationally recognized artists such as Jiro Takamatsu, Kenny Scharf and Bernd Koberling while increasingly supporting emerging and mid-career artists offering fresh perspectives. Though many represented artists work primarily in painting, the gallery also embraces sculpture, installation, photography and other interdisciplinary media. In recent years it has expanded beyond Japan through participation in international art fairs and collaborations, particularly in Asia, connecting Japanese artists with global audiences. Beyond its main spaces, the gallery organizes exhibitions across several Tokyo venues, presenting roughly forty shows a year.",
